      "value": "Yeah, having it entirely dominate the big-menu is really dumb. I could personally not care less about any of its content.. The *friend* part, which, is the only thing I care about, is almost hidden beneath all the other stuff.. And the other stuff isn't even related to groups you are in.. utterly useless.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
