  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-04T20:55:44.094Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Update: The Live Now occasionally takes over the full size menu when going to where the Launchpad is, and there is no longer a full-size button on the esc menu. \n\nThe new Live Now is entirely irrelevant to the average user's VRChat experience. It's visually busy and removed quick access to useful navigation. There is never a reason to alter workflows like that. Adding features - fine. Forcing a total change of usage pattern - Bad. \n\nThis would be a useful snap-in to add to a collapsible panel or a customizable button panel (something the Launchpad ought to have had). The Launchpad was a great default panel as it had all those quick launch buttons, and relevant current information. it just lacked flexibility and user customizability. Live Now feels like it would have been better as an augment to it, rather than a replacement.",
